{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fa27e191fc2025180264751f7783e0d085bb235358d960f9e68104bc92b6007f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_12:1_2_014_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc8cee7f329649f8133b674104e20416b4245af745f445a297a462da6dc7e60a",
      "text": "3月7日的“特别工作”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_12:1_2_014_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68247e4b0a01e9fc0f9fe4ee3cd7717dafb20845c17ae2c66b61f3117dd6584f",
      "text": "英雄接到了在生日当天的单独工作委托。受到龙和诚司的鼓励，他怀着万全的状态迎来了当天，但在现场等待着英雄的，却是意想不到的特别工作……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_12:1_2_014_12_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e8243762b8a8480740f8d5c72164a804138141ccaa1c101b56d74c97f3156a6",
      "text": "差不多可以了吧？\n我把今天视频直播的标题改一下哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_12:1_2_014_12_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6de741be064d5b0a448690b05a8ec4a352bf006a7f975e0f56ff5b544b2207a1",
      "text": "“315 Pro特别直播”变更为……“握野英雄\n生日直播”！……啊，有评论进来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_12:1_2_014_12_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d95d46bac298a40701054fd5a6a1886d485f41c6a99890f2b65d0406fef2125d",
      "text": "之前明明一直对详情保密，\n却已经有这么多满怀期待的粉丝了吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_12:1_2_014_12_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f68a7bab50058289a621aee912b27bc5bffafdf8d47a2e0b8c3ca699579ea87",
      "text": "粉丝中或许也有光凭日期就猜到的英雄的粉丝呢。\n虽然本人完全没有察觉到就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_12:1_2_014_12_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae22721d8b3b3570a5265d87bbe41be77cadb6b53dc3e9b38290b3f1552b87af",
      "text": "英雄先生就是那么专注在工作上嘛。\n好啦，我们也差不多该出发了吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_12:1_2_014_12_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11f5cdbbbb56fac92830a780f9c44055c810e3109ce58a465ca0c6c86fcea811",
      "text": "反正直播里也会拍到，\n蛋糕和礼物都要小心保管带着走才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_12:1_2_014_12_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64eaba1f5371895e94ab508ec111274f399a51c7b65659ae394e56f7abd8bd6b",
      "text": "今年的蛋糕也很好吃啊。\n你们每次做手艺都会进步呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_12:1_2_014_12_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7860a307d64610624033df59524515aa4f5c94aa87693edd6b37ee41000c98b",
      "text": "哈哈，能让你高兴就比什么都好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_12:1_2_014_12_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e408db913517495e2ed4d94aabe6c62c84fd87bc9e53512ac9d54990c36ba970",
      "text": "关于蛋糕的评论也超级多呢。\n比如“教教怎么做！”之类的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_12:1_2_014_12_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f7959a47a7284927e7210225604155c3d7d00936689408aff7f4c3874a21259",
      "text": "怎么做啊……那下次要不要开个\n三人一起做蛋糕的直播？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_12:1_2_014_12_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0094ae07a195065837a34d586de624bf7d7052970ab2d151b2acc6660c89678",
      "text": "哈哈，不错啊。\n也找龙商量一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_12:1_2_014_12_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2306499729c2b5ddea901f7677f92513f35545b96e6e07ed36353e9df03287e6",
      "text": "真是的，完全被吓到了啊。\n突袭搞直播什么的我都紧张死了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_12:1_2_014_12_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed8df4eaefc7b99dcdf3221d1a98d5b52e45d29da9ff95101dae50fff7d9c3ba",
      "text": "嘿嘿，惊喜大获成功呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_12:1_2_014_12_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3afd91d7b085e981217795aac07d68d7062aed9f1cff3a106f49484de8392bd8",
      "text": "虽然拧开塑料瓶那一瞬间，\n碳酸饮料一口气喷出来让人手忙脚乱就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_12:1_2_014_12_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0847dc719d78bf1d1363810736b627e8badb9440a9ec5a44a5f57ae38674d976",
      "text": "但蛋糕算是死守住了。说实话，那才是最\n吓人的地方啊。观众们也都看嗨了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_014hid_2_1_2_014_12:1_2_014_12_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a99e12c53e3f187e6a18ab1bbc1c558ec81920b0d519bc8eb52b4493a43b00c4",
      "text": "啊哈哈，大家都在讨论我们以超绝的配合救下了蛋糕呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
